23	/* The data half of the dashboard. The view is a verbatim port of the design
24	   sandbox and must stay that way; everything variable is assembled here.
25	
26	   Uptime is now real: the worker samples every server every 5 minutes and
27	   lib/uptime.ts folds that into daily counters. It reads "—" until enough
28	   samples exist, never "0%", because unmeasured is not the same as down.
29	
30	   Live CPU / memory / storage / network utilisation is still the one figure
31	   with no source here. It EXISTS in production — lib/proxmox.ts's `vmStatus`
32	   returns it per VM — but the Proxmox endpoint is deliberately dead in this
33	   sandbox, so there is nothing to call. Marked SANDBOX-ONLY at the point of
34	   use. Note for whoever wires it: it is one API round-trip PER SERVER, so it
35	   wants to be a client-side fetch after paint, not an await in this function. */
